{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act14side_level_act14side_01_beg",
  "groupId": "act14side",
  "stageId": "act14side_01",
  "title": "不歡而聚",
  "storyCode": "BI-1",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act14side/level_act14side_01_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "1e0da0058d1fc2364531a50cacbc847d05c4291069da94a2923e72178e3947bd",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "出差的經理",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "text": "老闆，只是塊破木牌而已，為什麼賣五十鎊這麼貴？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝拉格商人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "text": "客人，這您就不懂了，這可不是什麼普通的木牌，這是雪境之神耶拉岡德的祝福。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝拉格商人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "text": "謝拉格能夠免受天災侵襲，扎根於這片土地，都是多虧了祂的庇佑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝拉格商人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "text": "而這塊護符的原材料，可是取自我們謝拉格第二高的山峰少女峰峰頂的常綠喬木。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝拉格商人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "text": "少女峰您知道嗎？傳說啊，那座峰是耶拉岡德流下的眼淚結冰而成的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝拉格商人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "text": "受山上雪水澆灌的樹木滿含著耶拉岡德對這片土地的慈愛與祝福，用這木料製成的護符更是能保佑出入平安，祛災辟邪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝拉格商人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "text": "看您是第一次來謝拉格，想要給在維多利亞的家人帶一些紀念品吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "出差的經理",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "text": "你怎麼知道？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝拉格商人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "text": "哎呀，這兩年，被恩希歐迪斯老爺的政策吸引來的大公司員工越來越多了，您的口音我一聽就聽出來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝拉格商人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "text": "像您這樣初來乍到的人呢，我是特別推薦您購買這個護符作為紀念品的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝拉格商人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "text": "不知您有沒有聽說過山雪鬼？是我們這深山裡頭的食人怪物，面目猙獰，似人非人，神出鬼沒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝拉格商人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "text": "但只要您戴著這受了蔓珠院賜福的護符，它們就會在耶拉岡德的威光下畏縮，不能傷你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝拉格商人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "text": "您想，您帶回去和您的家人說，這護符有謝拉格聖山的神力庇佑，也有面子不是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝拉格商人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "text": "您大老遠跑到謝拉格出差，也不想回去沒有什麼好東西帶給家人吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "出差的經理",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "出差的經理",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "text": "......嘖，好吧，我買了，給我的老婆孩子各買一塊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝拉格商人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "text": "好，就喜歡您這樣豪爽的人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我看啊，這木材恐怕是隨便找個山頭砍來的吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝拉格商人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "text": "？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝拉格商人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "text": "你、你憑什麼這麼說？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "text": "首先，沒有佩爾羅契家的許可，根本沒有人可以攀爬少女峰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "text": "其次，我可從沒聽說過之前有人爬上過少女峰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "text": "我離開謝拉格的時候，還特意囑咐過魏斯哥，要是有人爬上去了給我報個信呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝拉格商人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "text": "你怎麼知道......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝拉格商人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "text": "等等，這個尾巴......您難道是恩希亞小姐？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "出差的經理",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "text": "恩希亞......你、您是恩希歐迪斯先生的妹妹？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "text": "嗯哼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "出差的經理",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "text": "喂，老闆，你難道真的在騙我？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝拉格商人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "text": "哎呀，哈哈哈，聽說恩希亞小姐自幼熱愛登山，對於雪山的瞭解果然比我們普通人要強。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝拉格商人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "text": "我店裡的這些貨其實也是從山上的獵人那裡進的，肯定是那些獵人騙了我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝拉格商人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "text": "我之後就去找他們算帳！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝拉格商人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "text": "至於這個護符......恩希亞小姐，您看？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "text": "這個護符有蔓珠院的賜福倒不假，沒有謝拉格人膽敢偽造蔓珠院的印信冒犯耶拉岡德。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "text": "想憑它抵擋傳聞中的山雪鬼就算了吧。不過當作紀念品帶回去的話，我覺得應該還是很合適的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "text": "所以，賣便宜點就好啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝拉格商人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "text": "呼......既然如此，我這就把定價改成十鎊！那，這位先生，您還買嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "出差的經理",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "text": "既然那位恩希歐迪斯先生的妹妹都這麼說了，我肯定是相信的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "出差的經理",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "text": "老闆你做生意也不容易，我買五個吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝拉格商人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "text": "好的好的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝拉格商人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "text": "恩希亞小姐呢，您要買一些什麼嗎？只要是您喜歡的，您隨便拿就是，畢竟我這生意也是受了希瓦艾什家的照顧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "text": "不用不用，我正常付錢就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希亞",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
      "text": "對吧，博士？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "當然。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "幸好特意換了不少維多利亞和卡西米爾貨幣。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "恩希亞",
              "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
              "text": "哎呀，反正換了再多，也只能在我們家的領地用。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "恩希亞",
              "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
              "text": "而我們家的領地中，最繁榮的就是這座貿易港了，所以博士你就算把錢全都花在這裡也沒關係的。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "既然是自家的領地，不能隨便拿嗎？",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "恩希亞",
              "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
              "text": "欸，博士，別人也是要做生意的呀。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "恩希亞",
              "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
              "text": "不過，你要是真的想，我們可以去拜託老哥試試看。反正老哥會處理好的！"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "魏斯",
          "speakerId": "char_198_blackd",
          "text": "二小姐，我們差不多該去車站等車了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "恩希亞",
          "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
          "text": "啊，現在時間緊，博士，我們出發吧。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "大雪將至，當心些，外鄉人。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你是？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "不想受凍的話，現在離開還不算晚。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "恩希亞",
          "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
          "text": "博士，你在發什麼呆？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "有人向我搭話。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "恩希亞",
          "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
          "text": "嗯？可是你身邊沒有人啊。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "現在並不是能夠愜意地在室外享受咖啡的季節。\n回首望去，你只看見了鮮豔的遮陽棚頂與喀蘭貿易的廣告標語。\n空無一人的露台靜默著，一如遠處的皚皚山巒。\n或許是桌上的雜誌被風翻動書頁的嘩嘩聲讓你產生了有人坐在桌邊向你搭話的錯覺。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "恩希亞",
          "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
          "text": "博士，別發呆了，走了走了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "我們還會再見面的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "魏斯",
          "speakerId": "avg_198_blackd_1",
          "text": "角峰大哥，你來了，老爺正在等你。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "角峰",
          "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
          "text": "這段時間辛苦你了，魏斯。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "角峰",
          "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
          "text": "你不用去嗎？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "魏斯",
          "speakerId": "avg_198_blackd_1",
          "text": "本來要去的，不過老爺想要邀請博士一同前往聖山出席三族議會，讓我留下來代替你接待他們，畢竟我也算羅德島的一員。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "魏斯",
          "speakerId": "avg_198_blackd_1",
          "text": "你在外保護二小姐這麼久，老爺覺得你也該放個假了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "魏斯",
          "speakerId": "avg_198_blackd_1",
          "text": "而且，看樣子，你應該是被二小姐趕出來的吧？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "角峰",
          "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
          "text": "哈哈，是。二小姐在和博士一起逛街。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "角峰",
          "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
          "text": "二小姐也是想給我放個假，就讓我不用管她了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "魏斯",
          "speakerId": "avg_198_blackd_1",
          "text": "不愧是兄妹。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "魏斯",
          "speakerId": "avg_198_blackd_1",
          "text": "怎麼樣，這次回來的感覺？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "角峰",
          "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
          "text": "領地建設很快，整體變化很大，已經快要認不出來了。不愧是老爺。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "角峰",
          "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
          "text": "那承蒙老爺和二小姐的厚意，我先回一趟老家，看看父母，然後去老爺那裡待命。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "角峰",
          "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
          "text": "你呢？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "魏斯",
          "speakerId": "avg_198_blackd_1",
          "text": "我？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "角峰",
          "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
          "text": "你也有一陣子沒回來了吧，上次見面的時候，你不是要跟老爺去哥倫比亞？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "魏斯",
          "speakerId": "avg_198_blackd_1",
          "text": "我沒什麼要緊事情，能回來在街上轉轉就很滿足了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "角峰",
          "speakerId": "avg_199_yak_1",
          "text": "你那個同族的老朋友呢？我記得是叫莫希吧，有空一起吃頓飯吧。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "魏斯",
          "speakerId": "avg_198_blackd_1",
          "text": "這個......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "魏斯",
          "speakerId": "avg_198_blackd_1",
          "text": "......到時候再看情況吧。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sharp",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_252",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sharp",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_252",
          "text": "是我。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "極光",
          "speakerId": "avg_422_aurora_1",
          "text": "聽得到嗎？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sharp",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_252",
          "text": "聽得到。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "極光",
          "speakerId": "avg_422_aurora_1",
          "text": "太好了，看來基地台的信號沒有問題。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sharp",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_252",
          "text": "嗯。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sharp",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_252",
          "text": "如何？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "極光",
          "speakerId": "avg_422_aurora_1",
          "text": "我找到了幾個適合安裝通訊基地台的隱蔽地點。不過無論如何，在圖里卡姆安裝基地台的話，是不可能覆蓋到整個謝拉格的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "極光",
          "speakerId": "avg_422_aurora_1",
          "text": "這裡是謝拉格南側門戶，事實上也是謝拉格唯一和外界聯通的關口。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "極光",
          "speakerId": "avg_422_aurora_1",
          "text": "在這裡建立通訊網的意義非常重大，但想要讓通訊覆蓋整個謝拉格，就最好在中央的湖區周邊再部署幾個簡易基地台。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sharp",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_252",
          "text": "我不是問你這個。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "極光",
          "speakerId": "avg_422_aurora_1",
          "text": "......？隊長你讓我出去逛逛不是讓我去踩點的嗎？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sharp",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_252",
          "text": "我是問，你很久沒回謝拉格了，感覺如何？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "極光",
          "speakerId": "avg_422_aurora_1",
          "text": "哦......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "極光",
          "speakerId": "avg_422_aurora_1",
          "text": "老實說，我覺得很不可思議。我通過希瓦艾什家的人才培養計畫離開謝拉格時，也是從這裡出發的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "極光",
          "speakerId": "avg_422_aurora_1",
          "text": "那時，不要說國境線列車站了，連這圖里卡姆，也還是一座很普通的小鎮。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "極光",
          "speakerId": "avg_422_aurora_1",
          "text": "沒想到它能有這麼大的變化。現在就算和外面的城市比，也可以說毫不遜色了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "極光",
          "speakerId": "avg_422_aurora_1",
          "text": "要在雪山上做這樣的建設，有多大難度我想都不敢想。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sharp",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_252",
          "text": "挺好。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "極光",
          "speakerId": "avg_422_aurora_1",
          "text": "隊長，你們現在在哪，我來找你們。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sharp",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_252",
          "text": "我們正要坐列車去喀蘭聖山。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sharp",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_252",
          "text": "你先不用過來。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "極光",
          "speakerId": "avg_422_aurora_1",
          "text": "欸？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sharp",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_252",
          "text": "你說過，你家在山上的工業區吧。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "極光",
          "speakerId": "avg_422_aurora_1",
          "text": "是的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sharp",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_252",
          "text": "先回家看看。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sharp",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_252",
          "text": "沒什麼比家人更重要。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "極光",
          "speakerId": "avg_422_aurora_1",
          "text": "但是......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sharp",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_252",
          "text": "你既然都已經回到雪山了，正好是回家看看的機會，這也是博士的意思。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "極光",
          "speakerId": "avg_422_aurora_1",
          "text": "博士也這麼說？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "極光",
          "speakerId": "avg_422_aurora_1",
          "text": "......我知道了，那就恭敬不如從命。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "極光",
          "speakerId": "avg_422_aurora_1",
          "text": "至於博士那邊......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sharp",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_252",
          "text": "有我跟著。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "廣播",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_252",
          "text": "開往喀蘭聖山腳下的列車即將發車。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "廣播",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_252",
          "text": "請還沒上車的旅客抓緊上車。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sharp",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_252",
          "text": "我要出發了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sharp",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_252",
          "text": "好好休息，極光。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "伴著汽笛聲以及輕微的通訊聲，開往聖山的列車緩緩啟動。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "恩希亞",
          "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
          "text": "博士，我來給你介紹一下這些山峰的名字吧。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "恩希亞",
          "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
          "text": "你看，那座坡有些平緩的山峰叫作少女峰，是第三代聖女命名的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "恩希亞",
          "speakerId": "avgnew_173_slchan_1",
          "text": "那邊那座很陡峭的山峰，叫作馬特洪峰，其實也是角峰名字的來源。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "......\n恩希亞滔滔不絕地講述著沿途的風景以及與謝拉格有關的一切。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "訊使帶著一如既往的笑容，在一旁安靜地聆聽，但他時不時投向遠方的眼神，帶著一絲說不清的情緒。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "Sharp靠在座椅上瀏覽著網頁，他會發現，謝拉格的網路內容充實得出乎他意料。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "你一邊聽著恩希亞的話，一邊將視線投向窗外。\n窗外，倒映著藍天的湖泊上殘留著薄冰，一些本地人聚在淺灘邊，有的打水有的洗衣，有說有笑。\n白雪皚皚的群山巍然屹立，想要抬頭去看它的尖端，就會被陽光阻攔。\n平緩的山腰上，年輕的牧人驅趕著牧獸群向家裡走去，見到列車上的人，他沒有驚訝，反而舉起鞭子向這邊打招呼。\n不遠處，是他居住的村莊，炊煙嫋嫋，安靜祥和。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "一切都令人心曠神怡。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "或許，這會是一次不錯的旅行。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": [
    {
      "speakerId": "char_198_blackd",
      "aliases": [
        "魏斯"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
